<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2114_7919.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig dienst, unnd was wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermögend, zuovor, fromm, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersamm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonders</unclear> guot fründt, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethrüw</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hat</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baschi</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hälffenberger</unclear></persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-166" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Urnen</unclear></placeName> der <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">S</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Galler</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bott</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichtet</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Was</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>zyts mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jeremias</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Locheren</unclear></persName> dem
<lb n="8"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Liudauwer</unclear></placeName> botten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">spann</unclear> unnd rechtfertigung ge-
<lb n="9"/>wachsen, von wegen 80. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gl</unclear>. so von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-221" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Memingen</unclear></placeName> naher
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnserem</unclear> burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hanß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Heinrichzen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Müller</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">über</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reicht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllen</unclear>, unnd aber nebent sich khomen,
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellich</unclear> gelt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Locher</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baschi</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogestelt</unclear> haben
<lb n="13"/>wöllen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölliches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> üch by dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eyd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beste</unclear>-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tiget</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Daruff</unclear> nun <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unangesehzen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> diß
<lb n="15"/>gelt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">niemalnn</unclear> empfangen, sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entlich</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Locheren</unclear> inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> alhie, dahin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verglich</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/>en, den halben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">theil</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölliches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verluests</unclear>, so sich
<lb n="18"/>mit dem costen inn allem uff die 120. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gl</unclear>. beloffen,
<lb n="19"/>über sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zenemmen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Diewyl</unclear> sich
<lb n="20"/>aber an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetzt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befinde</unclear>, wie das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genannter</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><persName resp="#ner">Locher</persName> 60. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gl</unclear>. sambt einem brieff, so er von <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hanß</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Friderich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Trödeln</unclear></persName> zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-221" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Memingen</unclear></placeName> empfangen, und
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgedachtem</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Müller</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoschicken</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinderschlage</unclear>-
<lb n="24"/>en, unnd dahero er anders nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedencken</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khönne</unclear>, dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> derselbig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> vorangeregten
<lb n="26"/>80. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gl</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glychergstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umbgangen</unclear> syn werde, unnd
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllichem</unclear> nach er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesinnet</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Locheren</unclear> von deß-
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">elben</unclear> wegen by üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzelangen</unclear>, Als syge
<lb n="29"/>an unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernstliche</unclear> bitt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> hier-
<lb n="30"/>zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürdernuß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mittheilen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllind</unclear>.
<lb n="31"/>Wann nun wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Helffenberger</persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> syn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weigeren</unclear> wöllen, So ist an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellind</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> üch
<lb n="34"/>Inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diserem</unclear> synem anligen günstig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevolchen</unclear> syn
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2114_7920.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="35"/>laßen, unnd ime gegen gesagtem Locher verholffen
<lb n="36"/>syn, das ime alles das jhenig widerumb erstatt-
<lb n="37"/>et werden moege, was sich von rechts und billigkeit
<lb n="38"/>wegen erfinden unnd gebueren wirt. Wie
<lb n="39"/>unns nit zwyflet, ir ohne das zethuond geneigt
<lb n="40"/>syn, unnd den sachen in gebür zubegegnen wol
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdint</unclear>. Das woellind ir von
<lb n="42"/>unns als gebetten im guotem verstahn, und üch
<lb n="43"/>zu unns jederzyt aller eidtgnößischen thrüw und
<lb n="44"/>fründtschafft im besten fürohin versechen, unns
<lb n="45"/>sambtlich damit goettlichem schirm beuelchende.
<lb n="46"/>Geben den <origDate when="1619-01-29" resp="#ner">29ten Januarij, anno 1619</origDate>.
<lb n="47"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
<lb n="48"/>der statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2114_7921.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2114_7922.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="49"/>Den frommen, fürsichtigen,
<lb n="50"/>ehrsammen, wysen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger=
<lb n="51"/>meister unnd Rath der statt
<lb n="52"/>St. Gallen</orgName>, unserenn ins=
<lb n="53"/>sonnders guoten fründen, und
<lb n="54"/>gethruwenn lieben eidtgnossen.
</p>
